ld #AF87FF]Generic gate presentation panel and origin fields[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: add the `presentation.panel` and `presentation.origin_agent` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate request fields, their normalization and validation, their [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]projection into notification `action_data`, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`GateAdapter.display_title` field, the matching `sase gate create` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]options, and the gate documentation and skill-source updates.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task triage gate identity, filer, and self-heal[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bead-gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead-gate: rename the task triage sender to `bead`, shorten its note to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`<bead-id> — <title>`, route it to the `beads` panel, carry the bead's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filer through `origin_agent` and the Markdown preview, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel-and-recreate pending gates that still use the previous [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Panel tabs and filer line in the notification modal[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]inbox[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inbox: resolve notification modal tabs from the declared panel ahead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the synthetic HITL and Errors tabs, order and label panel tabs, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render the filing agent on the detail pane's meta line.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate action panel title and filer line[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]action-panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]action-panel: title the generic gate review modal from its adapter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of the hardcoded \"Custom Gate\" string and render a \"Filed by\" [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line above the Context section when the gate declares an origin agent.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]PNG snapshot coverage and documentation sweep[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visuals[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bead-gate, inbox, action-panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visuals: add PNG snapshot goldens for the Beads tab, the filer meta [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line, and the task triage action panel, then reconcile the notification [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and bead documentation with the shipped behavior.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-cz","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-cz.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ae7407c4c530319b3e1bbe0ab6663f71","started_at":"2026-08-01T11:07:22.965243+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"b93380a702d34b5d158651b459c7816737c3ebe23f361d1b9791c6554eaa6019","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cz.land/chat.md","size_bytes":13216},"commits":{"digest":"69cec65483bf7b11288152994bcb8728fc1f3909a3686261667e1456220dde0f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cz.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-cz.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"08d13e46dd573cfe9e2239b28de78e0785d1f4553fd2749472518a77f281eed3","path"